BT 1 0 0 1 0 47.5 Tm /F2 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 1.362685 Tw (Security and governance in low-code applications deal with controlling who can use an application, what) Tj T* 0 Tw .540388 Tw (each person is permitted to do, and how the data and resources of the application are administered. Because) Tj T* 0 Tw .352349 Tw (low-code platforms make it easy to build applications that store business data, controlling access to that data) Tj T* 0 Tw (is an important part of application design.) Tj T* ET
