BT 1 0 0 1 0 76.5 Tm /F2 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 1.069435 Tw (Zoho Creator provides built-in mechanisms for this purpose. User permissions define the operations that a) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.777068 Tw (user may perform on the components of an application. Role-based access places users in roles that are) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.11123 Tw (arranged in a hierarchy, which influences the records that they can see. Data sharing rules extend the visibility) Tj T* 0 Tw .542449 Tw (of records from one role or user to another with a defined level of access. Administrative controls allow the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.701639 Tw (application to be configured and managed. Together, they help ensure that users receive only the access) Tj T* 0 Tw (needed for their responsibilities and that application data is protected from unauthorised use.) Tj T* ET
